@format 1
@id export.add-preset
@title Add export preset
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Create and persist a uniquely named custom export preset from the current tab-specific export state.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge
@flow TB
@related export.apply-preset, export.delete-preset

@alias export = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PExport

[input] Add preset requested <input>
- Receive the add-preset command @ export.PExportPresetAdd(...)
> create

[create] Create custom preset <process>
- Resolve a unique preset name and assign it to the current export state @ export.PExportPresetAdd(...)
- Persist the preset, select it, and refresh the export summary @ export.PExportPresetAdd(...)
> result

[result] Preset added <output>
= A new persisted custom preset is selected in the tab.
